Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:21:59.78,JoJo-main,Guy,0,0,0,,Eres Jotaro Kujo, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.78,0:22:02.25,JoJo-main,Guy,0,0,0,,Soy de la Fundación Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:09.17,JoJo-main,Guy,0,0,0,,Como estar cerca del tendido eléctrico\Ny líneas telefónicas es peligroso,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.17,0:22:12.05,JoJo-main,Guy,0,0,0,,vine a entregarte\Neste mensaje en persona.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.41,0:22:16.79,JoJo-main,Guy,0,0,0,,"Llegaré al puerto de Morioh\Nmañana al mediodía".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:26.51,JoJo-main,Guy,0,0,0,,Son palabras de Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.44,0:22:53.82,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.82,0:22:56.07,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.07,0:22:58.86,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:00.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.53,0:23:02.91,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.91,0:23:05.29,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.29,0:23:08.08,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:09.79,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.79,0:23:12.04,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:14.38,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
